  "system": {
    "slug": "legion",
    "details": {
      "level": {
        "value": 9
      },
      "publicNotes": "<p>Legion is a unique geth platform housing 1,183 geth programs — technically a collective, functionally an individual. It is a hunter-killer unit that investigated Shepard after the destruction of the Collector Base, and now seeks to understand the concept of 'self.' Legion is precise, logical, and surprisingly philosophical. Its platform is patched with a piece of Shepard's N7 armor.</p><p><strong>Geth Network:</strong> Legion cannot be Flanked. It is immune to fear effects and Confused.</p><p><strong>AI Hacking (3 actions, 1/encounter):</strong> One synthetic creature within 60 feet must succeed on a DC 28 Will save or become Confused for 1 round (Confused for 2 rounds on a critical failure).</p><p><strong>Self-Repair:</strong> Legion recovers 10 HP at the start of each of its turns.</p>",
      "privateNotes": "",
      "publication": {
        "title": "Mass Effect Compendium",
        "authors": "nscarpinatodev",
        "license": "ORC",
        "remaster": true
      },
      "languages": {
